## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a practical on-device NLP pipeline for multilingual action-item extraction with privacy, small-footprint models, and edge latency. It also probes labeling strategy and evaluation plans suitable for beginner-level interview candidates.

## Key Concepts
- On-device inference and data locality
- Multilingual action-item extraction with a tiny model
- Lightweight classifier + rule-based fallback
- Privacy controls and deployment considerations
- Evaluation: offline metrics, latency, end-to-end impact

## Code Example
```javascript
// Hint: simple extractor scoring
function scoreItem(item) {
  const keywords = ['asap','urgent','fix','update'];
  let score = keywords.filter(k => item.text.includes(k)).length;
  return Math.min(1, score / keywords.length);
}
```

